  "expirationDate": "2036-07-20",
  "historyNote": "#7931, eff 8-6-03, EXPIRED: 8-6-11 New. #11095, INTERIM, eff 5-12-16, EXPIRED: 11-8-16 New. #12040, eff 11-10-16; ss by #14594, eff 7-20-26, EXPIRES: 7-20-36",
